			"notes": "## What's New in v2.0.0\n\nDiscordCraft is a Discord integration plugin/mod for Minecraft servers that bridges your server with Discord, allowing seamless communication and server management.\n\n### Features\n\n- **Bidirectional Chat** — Messages flow between Minecraft and Discord in real-time\n- **Player Events** — Join, leave, death, and kill notifications sent to Discord\n- **Server Status** — Automatic start/stop announcements\n- **Discord Slash Commands** — Manage your server from Discord with `/ban`, `/pardon`, `/whitelist`, `/stop`, `/playerlist`, and more\n- **Channel Linking** — Link multiple Discord channels with customizable message filters\n- **Full Customization** — Configure all messages and commands via YAML files\n- **Bot Activity** — Set custom bot status (Playing, Watching, etc.)\n- **Multi-Platform Support** — Available for Spigot/Paper/Purpur (1.13+) and NeoForge (1.20.5+)\n- **Easy Setup** — Automated `/setup` command for quick configuration\n\n### Installation\n\nSee the **[Installation Guide](https://github.com/pablobh2147/discordcraft/blob/main/INSTALL.md)** for complete setup instructions."
		},
